sequenceDiagram
    participant Agent as AI Agent<br/>(MCP Client)
    participant Route as OpenShift Route<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS Edge
    participant MCP as rhoai-mcp Service<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    participant OIDC as OIDC Auth Middleware
    participant Provider as OIDC Provider<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant K8sTokenReview as K8s TokenReview API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant RBACChecker as RBAC Checker
    participant K8sSAR as K8s SubjectAccessReview<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Plugin as Domain Plugin
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant ModelReg as Model Registry<br/>8080/8443 TCP
    participant ModelCat as Model Catalog<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over Agent,K8sAPI: Flow 1: MCP Tool Call (OIDC Mode)
        Agent->>Route: POST /mcp (MCP protocol)<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
        Route->>MCP: Forward HTTP/8000<br/>Bearer token forwarded

        alt JWT Token Mode
            MCP->>OIDC: Validate token
            OIDC->>Provider: GET /.well-known/openid-configuration<br/>HTTPS/TLS 1.2+
            Provider-->>OIDC: JWKS keys
            OIDC->>OIDC: Validate JWT (RS256/ES256)<br/>Extract user identity
        else TokenReview Mode
            MCP->>OIDC: Validate token
            OIDC->>K8sTokenReview: POST TokenReview<br/>Auth: SA token
            K8sTokenReview-->>OIDC: User identity + groups
        end

        OIDC-->>MCP: UserContext set (contextvars)

        MCP->>RBACChecker: Check tool permissions
        RBACChecker->>K8sSAR: POST SubjectAccessReview<br/>Auth: SA token
        K8sSAR-->>RBACChecker: allowed/denied
        RBACChecker-->>MCP: Tool visibility filtered

        MCP->>Plugin: Execute tool handler
        Plugin->>K8sAPI: K8s API call<br/>Auth: User bearer token<br/>HTTPS/TLS 1.2+
        K8sAPI-->>Plugin: Resource response
        Plugin-->>MCP: Tool result
        MCP-->>Route: MCP response
        Route-->>Agent: HTTPS response
    end

    rect rgb(255, 248, 240)
        Note over Agent,ModelCat: Flow 2: Model Recommendation (Planner Local Mode)
        Agent->>Route: POST /mcp (recommend_model tool)<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
        Route->>MCP: Forward HTTP/8000

        MCP->>OIDC: Validate token
        OIDC-->>MCP: UserContext set

        MCP->>Plugin: Execute planner-composites
        Plugin->>ModelCat: GET benchmark data<br/>HTTPS/8443 TLS (service-serving CA)<br/>Auth: SA token
        ModelCat-->>Plugin: Benchmark data
        Plugin->>Plugin: llm-d-planner engine<br/>Compute recommendation
        Plugin-->>MCP: Model recommendation
        MCP-->>Route: MCP response
        Route-->>Agent: HTTPS response
    end

    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
        Note over Agent,ModelReg: Flow 3: Model Registry Query
        Agent->>Route: POST /mcp (model registry tool)<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
        Route->>MCP: Forward HTTP/8000

        MCP->>Plugin: Execute model_registry plugin
        Plugin->>ModelReg: REST API call<br/>HTTP/8080 or HTTPS/8443<br/>Auth: Bearer token forwarded
        ModelReg-->>Plugin: Model artifacts
        Plugin-->>MCP: Tool result
        MCP-->>Route: MCP response
        Route-->>Agent: HTTPS response
    end
